# Keep bytes stable across platforms.
#
# notify.ps1 carries a UTF-8 BOM and Chinese literals in the action label.
# Windows PowerShell 5.1 decodes a .ps1 file in the system code page unless a
# BOM says otherwise, so the file must be checked out exactly as committed.
# `-text` disables every end-of-line conversion for it.
*.ps1 -text
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf
